# CODEOWNERS for Airline Ground Handling Cost Management Platform

# GitHub uses the last matching rule. Keep defaults and broad source ownership
# first so the protected, narrower ownership rules below take precedence.
*                                         @ground-handling/developers

# Developers own the application source code and day-to-day task tracking
backend/                                  @ground-handling/developers
frontend/                                 @ground-handling/developers
e2e/                                      @ground-handling/developers
tasks/                                    @ground-handling/developers
obligations.json                          @ground-handling/developers
dependency-allowlist.json                 @ground-handling/developers
gates/                                    @ground-handling/developers

# DB and DevOps Admins own multi-tenant databases and topology definitions.
# The migration rule must remain after the broader backend rule.
backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/  @ground-handling/db-admins
topology.json                             @ground-handling/devops

# Platform Admin owns the high-level business requirement specifications
docs/PRD.md                               @ground-handling/platform-admin
docs/PHASES.md                            @ground-handling/platform-admin

# Tech Lead owns the canonical contracts and decision boundaries
docs/architecture-contract.md             @ground-handling/tech-lead
docs/development-contract.md              @ground-handling/tech-lead
decisions/architecture-log.json           @ground-handling/tech-lead
decisions/process-log.json                @ground-handling/tech-lead
